,"site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOI1QpCs4LUl24","tag_name":"v0.5.3","target_commitish":"develop","name":"v0.5.3","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2024-12-10T12:29:37Z","updated_at":"2024-12-10T12:42:43Z","published_at":"2024-12-10T12:42:43Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alek050/databallpy/tarball/v0.5.3","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alek050/databallpy/zipball/v0.5.3","body":"## What's Changed\r\n* Added way to get frame of tracking data based on team possession or event data team by @Alek050 in https://github.com/Alek050/databallpy/pull/251\r\n* Added easier way of getting filters on column ids by @Alek050 in https://github.com/Alek050/databallpy/pull/252\r\n* WIP: Bundesliga open data by @Alek050 in https://github.com/Alek050/databallpy/pull/253\r\n* Added ruff as linting manager by @Alek050 in https://github.com/Alek050/databallpy/pull/255\r\n* Logging wrapper by @Alek050 in https://github.com/Alek050/databallpy/pull/257\r\n* release for v0.5.2 by @Alek050 in https://github.com/Alek050/databallpy/pull/259\r\n* Statsbomb event parser by @DaanGro in https://github.com/Alek050/databallpy/pull/254\r\n* fixed bug opta positions by @Alek050 in https://github.com/Alek050/databallpy/pull/265\r\n* Add JSON parser for tracab metadata by @jan-swiatek in https://github.com/Alek050/databallpy/pull/266\r\n* Fixed some small bugs in synchronise, read tracab xml, and aligning players from tracking and event metadata by @Alek050 in https://github.com/Alek050/databallpy/pull/269\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @jan-swiatek made their first contribution in https://github.com/Alek050/databallpy/pull/266\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Alek050/databallpy/compare/v0.5.2...v0.5.3","mentions_count":3},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alek050/databallpy/releases/185592179","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alek050/databallpy/releases/185592179/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/Alek050/databallpy/releases/185592179/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/Alek050/databallpy/releases/tag/v0.5.2","id":185592179,"author":{"login":"Alek050","id":49450063,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NDUwMDYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49450063?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alek050","html_url":"https://github.com/Alek050","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alek050/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alek050/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alek050/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alek050/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alek050/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alek050/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alek050/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alek050/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alek050/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOI1QpCs4LD-lz","tag_name":"v0.5.2","target_commitish":"main","name":"v0.5.2","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2024-11-15T09:04:27Z","updated_at":"2024-11-15T09:07:03Z","published_at":"2024-11-15T09:07:03Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alek050/databallpy/tarball/v0.5.2","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alek050/databallpy/zipball/v0.5.2","body":"## V0.5.2 (15/11/2024)\r\n\r\n- Added `match.get_column_ids` with filters for team, player positions and minimal minutes played filters.\r\n- Added parser for DFL/Sportec Solutions event data\r\n- Added parser for Tracab xml format, used by DFL and Sportec solutions\r\n- Added integration for open data from DFL (open sourced by Bassek et al.)\r\n\r\n### Breaking changes\r\n- From now on, `match.home_players_column_ids()` and `match.away_players_column_ids()` are depreciated and will be removed in V0.7.0. Please use `match.get_column_ids()` in future version.\r\n- `get_open_match()` will now, by default, load in match `J03WMX` (1. FC Köln vs. FC Bayern München) instead of the anonimysed match from Metrica. To load in the metrica match, please parse `provider=\"metrica\"` in the key word arguments.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alek050/databallpy/releases/185592179/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alek050/databallpy/releases/179775056","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alek050/databallpy/releases/179775056/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/Alek050/databallpy/releases/179775056/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/Alek050/databallpy/releases/tag/v0.5.1","id":179775056,"author":{"login":"Alek050","id":49450063,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NDUwMDYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49450063?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alek050","html_url":"https://github.com/Alek050","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alek050/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alek050/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alek050/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alek050/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alek050/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alek050/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alek050/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alek050/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alek050/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOI1QpCs4KtyZQ","tag_name":"v0.5.1","target_commitish":"main","name":"Version 0.5.1","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2024-10-10T15:09:11Z